  1168  *>*******************************************
  1169  *>                                          *
  1170  *>  Record Definition For The System File   *
  1171  *>                                          *
  1172  *>*******************************************
  1173  *>  File size 1024 with fillers
  1174  *>   Cleared down update details 01/02/09 to 12/06/13
  1175  *>
  1176  *> 22/09/15 vbc - Added Param-Restrict (Access) within a current filler.
  1177  *>                Set this will stop display of option Z in sub-system menus.
  1178  *>                Need to detect actual user though when setup or could just use
  1179  *>                chown for sys002 to admin user?
  1180  *> 25/06/16 vbc - Added RDBMS-Port & needs RDBMS-Host, RDBMS-Socket.
  1181  *>                Increased 'System-data' from 384 to 512 bytes & removed O/E
  1182  *>                  Block (128) as it is unused.
  1183  *> 26/06/16 vbc - Updated MySQL Load scripts ACASDB.sql in ACAS/mysql.
  1184  *>                  Prima is yet to be done !!!
  1185  *> 19/10/16 vbc - Changed PL-Approp-AC in IRS block from 9(5) to 9(6) for GL
  1186  *>                support & reduced filler by 1.
  1187  *>                With IRS data mapped into ACAS the IRS block can reduce to 32 bytes
  1188  *>                Just need to change all of the IRS programs to use ACAS fields but
ACS Cobol Xref v2.03.18          Dictionary File for PY030    09/04/2026  19:12:41:71                                  Page   23

  1189  *>                also NEED to change the date processing to use same in rest of ACAS
  1190  *>                and not binary days since 01/01/2000 and hold dates in dd/mm/yy form.
  1191  *>                Added 2 88s to Op-System for IRS.
  1192  *> 27/10/16 vbc - Changed level-5 to IRS instead of omitted O/E.
  1193  *> 15/01/18 vbc - Added Stats-Date-Period with a filler & vers = 14.
  1194  *> 02/02/18 vbc - Replaced file-statuses with filler x(32).
  1195  *> 10/02/18 vbc - For PL-Approp-AC6 move filler to beginning of field as irs
  1196  *>                does not need the leading digit (uses only 5).
  1197  *> 17/03/18 vbc - Added SL-Invoice-Lines within last filler so gone from 45 to 43.
  1198  *> 18/03/18 vbc - Added false for Level-5 & 6, e.g., zero.
  1199  *> 06/06/18 vbc - Added six new fields as bin-long to support for G-L and IRS used at same time.
  1200  *>                RDBMS needs to be updated. Done 06/06/16 -> Mariadb backups.
  1201  *>                sys002 needs to be updated if implemented.
  1202  *>                systemMT needs to be updated (in un/load moves).
  1203  *> 03/06/20 vbc - Changes to some RDBMS values.
  1204  *> 10/12/22 vbc - Remove File-Duplicates-In-Use - not used.
  1205  *> 14/04/23 vbc - SL-Autogen added (& PL-Autogen) both using FILLER space.
  1206  *> 15/05/23 vbc - SL-Next-Rec and PL-Next-Rec bin-short unsigned for next Autogen record key.
  1207  *> 26/06/23 vbc - Added Company-Email repacing filler.
  1208  *> 09/09/23 vbc - Pre support for OE but as comments for now as will not be used in ACAS - pointless.
  1209  *> 10/09/23 vbc - Removed condition Payroll-No as not used.
  1210  *> 13/03/24 vbc - In fillers added fields SL-BO-Flag and Stk-BO-Active,
  1211  *> 18/12/24 vbc - Clean up remd out texts & added Co. Phone No reducing filler.
  1212  *> 14/11/25 vbc - Support for Payroll in use that replaces OE usage as not needed.
