  1683  *> Force Esc, PgUp, PgDown, PrtSC to be detected
  1684       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_EXCEPTIONS" to "Y".
  1685       set      ENVIRONMENT "COB_SCREEN_ESC" to "Y".
  1686       move     CURRENT-DATE to WSE-Date-block.
