  1719       subtract 2 from WS-Env-Lines giving WS-22-Lines.
  1720       subtract 1 from WS-Env-Lines giving WS-23-Lines.
  1721       move     WS-Env-Lines to WS-Lines.
  1722       move     zero         to WS-Term-Code.
