  1891  *> **                                                           **
  1892  *> ** This copybook defines an EVALUATE statement capable of    **
  1893  *> ** translating two-digit FILE-STATUS codes to a message.     **
  1894  *> **                                                           **
  1895  *> ** Use the REPLACING option to COPY to change the names of   **
  1896  *> ** the MSG and STATUS identifiers to                         **
  1897  *> ** the names your program needs.                             **
  1898  *> Such as replacing STATUS by fs-reply msg by exception-msg.   **
  1899  *>                                                              **
  1900  *> ** chg 09/08/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  1901  *> ** Chg 11/12/23 vbc for missing statuses                     **
  1902  *> ** Chg 10/04/25 vbc match all quotes & spacing/layout        **
  1903  *> ** chg to FREE format                                        **
  1904  *> ** Chg 24/08/25 vbc #91 description.                         **
  1905  *> ** Chg 15.11.25 vbc Replace all ' for "                      **
  1906  *> ***************************************************************
  1907  *>
  1908   EVALUATE PY-PR1-Status
  1909   WHEN "00" MOVE "Success                  " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1910   WHEN "02" MOVE "Success Duplicate        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1911   WHEN "04" MOVE "Success Incomplete       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1912   WHEN "05" MOVE "Success Optional, Missing" TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1913   when "06" move "Multiple Records LS      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1914   WHEN "07" MOVE "Success No Unit          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1915   when "09" move "Success LS Bad Data      " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1916   WHEN "10" MOVE "End Of File              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1917   WHEN "14" MOVE "Out Of Key Range         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1918   WHEN "21" MOVE "Key Invalid              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1919   WHEN "22" MOVE "Key Exists               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1920   WHEN "23" MOVE "Key Not Exists           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1921   WHEN "24" MOVE "Key Boundary violation   " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1922   WHEN "30" MOVE "Permanent Error          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1923   WHEN "31" MOVE "Inconsistent Filename    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1924   WHEN "34" MOVE "Boundary Violation       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1925   WHEN "35" MOVE "File Not Found           " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1926   WHEN "37" MOVE "Permission Denied        " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1927   WHEN "38" MOVE "Closed With Lock         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1928   WHEN "39" MOVE "Conflict Attribute       " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1929   WHEN "41" MOVE "Already Open             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1930   WHEN "42" MOVE "Not Open                 " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1931   WHEN "43" MOVE "Read Not Done            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1932   WHEN "44" MOVE "Record Overflow          " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1933   WHEN "46" MOVE "Read Error               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1934   WHEN "47" MOVE "Input Denied             " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1935   WHEN "48" MOVE "Output Denied            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1936   WHEN "49" MOVE "I/O Denied               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1937   WHEN "51" MOVE "Record Locked            " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1938   WHEN "52" MOVE "End-Of-Page              " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1939   WHEN "57" MOVE "I/O Linage               " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1940   WHEN "61" MOVE "File Sharing Failure     " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1941   WHEN "71" MOVE "Bad Character LS         " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1942   WHEN "91" MOVE "Feature Not Available    " TO WS-Eval-Msg
  1943            WHEN OTHER
